              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "がっき (gakki) is Sino-Japanese (kango): two Chinese characters read with their on'yomi, readings borrowed from Chinese. They are ga, \"music\" (Middle Chinese ngaewk) and ki, \"instrument\" (khijH) (KANJIDIC2; Middle Chinese in Baxter's transcription)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
